# Board XNU patches, one path per line in application order (patches/xnu/ of this repository).
#
# blueline adds bring-up diagnostics: an IRQ without a handler panics with the GIC state (run 10), and a stalled
# platform_stall_panic_or_spin panics with its value (run 14). The stage-band, bsd_init step-block and status-mark
# patches (runs 11-17) are kept in patches/xnu/ but no longer applied: no static colour areas on the OLED panel
# (owner, 2026-10-27). Otherwise the kernel behaviour it needs lives in the ARM64 and
# OS series of UniXNU and in UniXNU-sdm845-common (its series and drivers/ArmCpu). A board change goes here when it
# must be a patch; follow https://unixnu.com/xnu/source-and-patches#add-a-patch to export and order it.
zzz-blueline-irq-diagnostic.patch
zzz-blueline-stall-diagnostic.patch
